le value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 63% of normal in November to December and 136% in April to May. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 66% of normal. Grid 19085 had its driest year in 2007 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
